                        "entry_id": "dedbbf1b-d4c8-37ef-b65a-93c517e15d9e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "неол., социол. оцениваемый как правомочный; такой, чья власть, главенство признаётся большинством"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "64a06a03-8030-4dd5-8820-06fe589e9e0d",
                                "sense_id": "27e734ec-c6ac-38b7-b9cd-1041992898a9",
                                "text": "Таким образом, «некоренные» национальные группы свыклись с мыслью, что, поскольку уж республика называется Кыргызстан, то узкий слой технократической элиты кыргызской национальности легитимен как правящий и направляющий развитие республики в сторону, символизирующуюся с Южной Кореей."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e282e4d-cc1f-4135-b15f-df8e90aa7e4a",
                                "sense_id": "27e734ec-c6ac-38b7-b9cd-1041992898a9",
                                "text": "Любая власть, если она издает законы и обеспечивает их выполнение, легальна. Но в то же время она может оставаться непризнанной народом, т. е. не быть легитимной…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "923bc2db-f49d-48bd-8960-106857f0a45c",
                                "sense_id": "27e734ec-c6ac-38b7-b9cd-1041992898a9",
                                "text": "К середине июня 2011 года, несмотря на продолжавшуюся в Ливии гражданскую войну, ПНС во главе с Абдель Джалилом был признан легитимным ливийским представителем тринадцатью странами…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eee6706-6136-459a-8dc9-dfa1ee17f234",
                                "sense_id": "27e734ec-c6ac-38b7-b9cd-1041992898a9",
                                "text": "Чем более сомнительным способом власть установлена или удерживается, тем менее она легитимна и тем сильнее боится критики."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1b46b407-1718-486b-b003-02e1d5e64eca",
                        "source_entry_id": "dedbbf1b-d4c8-37ef-b65a-93c517e15d9e",
                        "target_lang_word": "legitimate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "legitimate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a59abb0b-2e7b-3d2c-8f8b-fdaf68c8c737",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In accordance with the law or established legal forms and requirements."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c67c9f27-912a-40e2-8791-a2a0fc580022",
                                                "sense_id": "a59abb0b-2e7b-3d2c-8f8b-fdaf68c8c737",
                                                "text": "Rodwell was sent off by referee Martin Atkinson - who has shown 15 red cards since the start of last season - after 23 minutes for what appeared to be a legitimate challenge on Suarez."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b48a0411-f904-4d1d-a021-67d9cecfede0",
                                                "sense_id": "a59abb0b-2e7b-3d2c-8f8b-fdaf68c8c737",
                                                "text": "According to the tweet, the encounter began with \"a traffic stop for unlawful speed.\" If so, then the initial stop was legitimate, but in and of itself that wouldn't be probable cause to search the car. It does give an officer the right to look inside, and if contraband is in plain view, that would be probable cause. Here we don't know whether the bag full of drugs marked \"BAG FULL OF DRUGS\" was laying out in plain view, but it seems entirely possible."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f178790c-1fe3-3163-8360-c14b93fa7ef9",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conforming to known principles, or established or accepted rules or standards; valid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a78c5454-ac5b-46fa-a72d-407be1393e68",
                                                "sense_id": "f178790c-1fe3-3163-8360-c14b93fa7ef9",
                                                "text": "legitimate reasoning; a legitimate standard or method"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9adf3a53-d2f2-425e-aa6b-c4e558f4102f",
                                                "sense_id": "f178790c-1fe3-3163-8360-c14b93fa7ef9",
                                                "text": "Tillotson still keeps his place as a legitimate English classic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a3e60db-523d-37fb-8a9c-64719c50922a",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Authentic, real, genuine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "48e12d81-0bbb-4173-9054-be605c0de903",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3e60db-523d-37fb-8a9c-64719c50922a",
                                                "text": "legitimate poems of Chaucer; legitimate inscriptions"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3efef74-df08-4204-8842-a5a9b391a64d",
                                                "sense_id": "6a3e60db-523d-37fb-8a9c-64719c50922a",
                                                "text": "The truth is, when we fail to protect legitimate rights of others and continue to expand the net of lies and defamation, every one would become victims one day including ourselves."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08af66ce-9b94-3938-bad5-517042a23208",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marital.",
                                            "Lawfully begotten, i.e. born to a married couple or later legitimated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a child"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3eb59d88-b4bd-36f9-be95-aa1471802fb1",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Marital.",
                                            "Legally married."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a sexual partner"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b374dd6-ca1a-45d1-a409-2a69d18f1074",
                                                "sense_id": "3eb59d88-b4bd-36f9-be95-aa1471802fb1",
                                                "text": "Besides his four legitimate wives, the caliph had dozens of concubines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6608c7e-ed70-315d-af24-45c4d544ecaf",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to hereditary rights."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a89eb249-3a1b-349f-a134-14c84b3f9957",
                                        "entry_id": "761bb422-d4cb-3453-ae85-f2cac7bc46d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Belonging or relating to the legitimate theater."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "legitimate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "014bd11a-85ad-392e-b4fe-39524a546abb",
                                        "entry_id": "2ada9508-ebf8-3623-ae83-52b5fad3a344",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person born to a legally married couple."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30fbd5be-5b25-4fbe-9e81-f48a20d3b6cb",
                                                "sense_id": "014bd11a-85ad-392e-b4fe-39524a546abb",
                                                "text": "But should a “holy alliance of legitimates” extinguish it, it will be but for a season."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7745ccca-784a-46c6-8da6-e29accb77e2b",
                                                "sense_id": "014bd11a-85ad-392e-b4fe-39524a546abb",
                                                "text": "This extraordinarily mixed family of legitimates and illegitimates seems to have maintained a certain kind of harmony."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecadd03d-29a7-4ea5-afdf-dd2606f2d3f7",
                                                "sense_id": "014bd11a-85ad-392e-b4fe-39524a546abb",
                                                "text": "His overweening pride received another shock through his new friends the legitimates."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "legitimate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "146f4c47-32e7-39ae-a41d-9b3148357401",
                                        "entry_id": "7f009ca4-10e6-30ac-ad18-ac735d9bc909",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make legitimate, lawful, or valid; especially, to put in the position or state of a legitimate person before the law, by legal means."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
